{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終わりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょとだけだらーんとして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後、ちょっとした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事とレッスン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か い ほ う か ん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達ともんじゃ行く約束した♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああああーもんじゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明太チーズもちー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに質問回答します。↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかはいつもオシャレだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"研究したりしてるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"研究というか、すきで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌とか見てるだけですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暇なときって何してるん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る。漫画雑誌読む。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーッとしてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついしてしまう癖ってあるん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータイで何か調べるときとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画面が出るまで待つとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指がちょいちょいちょいちょい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て動く。主に人差し指と中指 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顎に手をおくのも癖！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"尊敬する人っている？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いるよ！んー、あえて言わない笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問メッチャ来られるのって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しんどい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えやすいものを選んでます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しんどくないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、テスト期間など..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がなかったときは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お休みすることはあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョジョ知らないよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってるよーおしゃれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ流行ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ読む限りメンバーみんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョジョ化してますね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日常的に腕時計を使いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり使わないかなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクセ代わりに付けることはある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気に入った洋服はパッと買う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジックリ品定めして買う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...イメージ的にはパッと買ってそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、自分でなかなか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服を買う勇気がないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買って失敗したことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度かあったから←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は思い切って買えるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってきたけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優柔不断うじうじ発動"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買って後悔する前にママに聞いたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩んでから買うよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか大人買いしてみたいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンパーティするとしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな仮装がしたい？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もけもけのおばけ、ゾンビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/24/8911186/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！めがしゃきっとしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気合いいれる。乃木充！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}